# Key layout for the Goodix GT9110 touchscreen gesture-wakeup keys.
#
# The GT9110 firmware recognises several off-screen gestures. The kernel driver
# (drivers/input/touchscreen/GT9110/gt9xx.c) reports a distinct Linux keycode
# per gesture; those Linux codes are the "scan codes" below. Android's
# TouchscreenGesture HAL / LineageParts KeyHandler routes each gesture by its
# scan code, so the Android keycode each maps to here is only a benign carrier.
# Double-tap (0xCC) is reported as KEY_POWER by the driver and handled by the
# default DT2W path, so it is intentionally NOT listed here.
#
# scancode  =  Linux KEY_*   gesture
# 183          KEY_F13        draw C
# 184          KEY_F14        draw O
# 185          KEY_F15        draw M
# 186          KEY_F16        draw W
# 187          KEY_F17        draw S
# 188          KEY_F18        draw V
# 189          KEY_F19        draw e
# 190          KEY_F20        slide up
# 191          KEY_F21        slide down
# 192          KEY_F22        slide left
# 193          KEY_F23        slide right

key 183   F1    WAKE
key 184   F2    WAKE
key 185   F3    WAKE
key 186   F4    WAKE
key 187   F5    WAKE
key 188   F6    WAKE
key 189   F7    WAKE
key 190   F8    WAKE
key 191   F9    WAKE
key 192   F10   WAKE
key 193   F11   WAKE
